    "detailed_description": "An indie action-adventure game about a Zilla battling evil Bridge-Kin in San Francisco, on his way to Reach, Overcome, and Vanquish his Kaiju clan's ultimate foe - the God-Like Golden Gate Bridge. Explore the Bay Area (including Berkeley, Oakland, SF Downtown and more), vanquish over-the-top bosses, and make lifelong friends &amp; helpful allies as you quest to take down your Bridge-Kin prey. The Fiend shall Fall!",
